@page "/about"

<PageTitle>ShopHub - About Us</PageTitle>

<div class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
        <h1>About ShopHub</h1>
        <p>We're on a mission to make buying and selling simple for everyone.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-content">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
            ShopHub is a marketplace where buyers and sellers connect with ease.
            From clothing to electronics, furniture to fresh food — we bring everything
            you need into one place, with secure payments and fast delivery.
        </p>

        <h2>Our story</h2>
        <p>
            ShopHub started with a simple idea: local sellers deserve a platform that's
            easy to use and trusted by buyers. Today we help thousands of sellers grow
            their businesses and help buyers discover quality products at great prices.
        </p>

        <h2>What we stand for</h2>
        <ul class="values">
            <li>🛡️ <b>Trust:</b> Secure transactions and verified sellers.</li>
            <li>🚚 <b>Speed:</b> Fast, reliable delivery nationwide.</li>
            <li>🤝 <b>Community:</b> A marketplace that supports local businesses.</li>
            <li>⭐ <b>Quality:</b> Great products at fair prices.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</div>

<style>
    .about-page {
        padding: 20px 0;
    }

    .about-hero {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 55px 25px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db, #2c3e50);
        color: white;
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .about-hero h1 {
        font-size: 40px;
        margin: 0 0 10px;
    }

    .about-hero p {
        font-size: 18px;
        opacity: 0.9;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .about-content {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-content h2 {
        color: #2c3e50;
        font-size: 24px;
        margin: 30px 0 10px;
    }

    .about-content p {
        color: #555;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .values {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 15px 0 0;
    }

    .values li {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #2c3e50;
    }
</style>
